OL,3,GNEWSADrone restrictions during Tour of
OL,4,ABritain race
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrone operators have been warned not to
OL,7,Ffly them during the Tour of Britain
OL,8,Fcycle race.
OL,10,FStage three of the event will pass
OL,11,Fthrough East Yorkshire on Friday and a
OL,12,FNotice to Airmen (NOTAM) warning has
OL,13,Fbeen issued over the county up to an
OL,14,Faltitude of 2,700 ft (823m) between
OL,15,F08:45 and 15:45 BST.
OL,17,FHumberside Police said anyone who
OL,18,Fwishes to fly a drone in the area "must
OL,19,Fobtain permission" from its drone team.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
