OL,3,GNEWSADrone restrictions during Tour of
OL,4,ABritain race
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said it was discouraging
OL,7,Fdrone flying "to maximise safety to the
OL,8,Fpublic and other aircraft which will be
OL,9,Foperating" including police drones and
OL,10,Fmedia filming from the air.
